  <ScenTitle>They Shall Not Pass, 1985</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;B&gt;Date:&lt;/B&gt; 29 November 1985 &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Location:&lt;/B&gt; GIUK Gap &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Playable Side:&lt;/B&gt; NATO &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Duration:&lt;/B&gt; 2 days &lt;BR&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Following an incident at sea between a US destroyer and a Soviet spy ship, the world teeters on the brink of World War Three. As the Soviet Red Banner North Fleet sorties from its bases in the Barents Sea, NATO submarines in the east Atlantic scramble to intercept the Red submarines before they can break out into the western Atlantic.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
